{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>FatYet 是一款主打溫柔覺察的身體狀態追蹤 App，適合希望在不受批判的情況下留意身心變化、並重視私隱的使用者。它以身體感受而非單純數字為核心，讓你每日記錄狀態與心情標籤，並可選擇追蹤體重及拍攝只存放於本機的進度照片。原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>私隱優先的身體覺察記錄</h2>\n<p>每日以身體感受滑桿記錄由輕盈到沉重的狀態，配合流動、靜止、深層休息等心情標籤，體重追蹤為可選項目。視覺化時間軸以日曆呈現歷程，附設身體起伏圖表與筆記文字雲，並可選擇與 Apple Health 雙向同步。資料只儲存於本機，無需帳號，亦可即時刪除。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-1-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-2-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-3-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-4-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：FatYet</li>\n<li>應用類別：Health &amp; Fitness</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-01T04:58:32.861127+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":315,"images":5,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}